:name: Sample MCU
:description: Cortex-M4 sample with 8 DI, 8 AI, 8 DO, 4 LEDs, and UART CLI

using sysbus

$NAME?="SampleMCU"
mach create $NAME

machine LoadPlatformDescription @sample_mcu.repl

# Eight 12-bit AI channels as a Python MMIO peripheral (script must be on Renode PATH).
$AI_SCRIPT?=@ai_regs.py
machine PyDevFromFile $AI_SCRIPT 0x40003000 0x20 true "ai"

cpu PerformanceInMips 100

$bin?=@../firmware/build/sample_mcu.elf

# Analyzer optional for interactive use; Robot attaches its own terminal tester.
# showAnalyzer uart0

macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $bin
    cpu SP `sysbus ReadDoubleWord 0x0`
    cpu PC `sysbus ReadDoubleWord 0x4`
"""

runMacro $reset

emulation Mode SynchronizedTimers
